==============================================
Crystal structure refinement (non-rigid atoms)
==============================================

Repeated SCF/rigid hirshfeld atom fits are performed
which eventually removes the rigid atom constraint.

Agreement statistics are shown at the start and end
of each 'micro' rigid fit cycle.

Convergence criteria for each fit-cycle are the same
as for convergence of the overall refinement

